{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:700","content":{"id":700,"title":"删除排序链表中的重复元素II","content":[{"children":[{"text":"题目描述","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"be7efb93-44a0-4761-b304-d4746a93e9e1","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"存在一个","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"highlight":true,"text":"按升序排列","type":"formatted"},{"text":"的链表，给你这个链表的头节点 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"head","type":"formatted"},{"text":" ，请你删除链表中所有存在数字重复情况的节点，只保留原始链表中没有重复出现的数字。返回同样按升序排列的结果链表。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f9eb6140-bb3c-489e-9aac-9df56a812e61","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"示例1：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6d1f5d45-e78d-4e8b-95d9-66b056f458ef","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"输入：1 -> 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 3 -> 4 -> null\n输出：2 -> 4 -> null","collabId":"12e49c94-9476-4994-a9f6-fd0fb0e87aa3","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"78708c43-0c13-4aba-b388-ff8c3de50b65","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"e592be58-5749-47ae-ae37-82c06ccae5e2"},{"children":[{"text":"示例2：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8c7a9997-fc3f-4295-a3df-524be19411a3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"输入：1 -> 2 -> 2 -> null\n输出：1 -> null","collabId":"457055c2-c31e-4efc-a6c3-6ec9972c311b","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"0dfa9904-f2f6-4884-9c49-7130fab49c1b","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b89a1b7d-e82e-4584-8e4a-71e14143795f"},{"children":[{"text":"解题思路","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"328fc63e-dae1-4b59-89b1-dc0eabd366d2","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"首先判断根节点是否与后面的节点重复(因为根节点前面没有节点，所以只需判断是否与后面的节点重复)，如果根节点不重复，则保留根节点，并且递归调用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"deleteDuplicates(head.next)","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ea278a56-3aac-436c-b2ef-83484b0d38f4","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果根节点是重复的(即与后面的节点的值相同)，则我们删除所有与根节点相同的节点，找到第一个与根节点不同的节点 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"node","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，然后递归调用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"deleteDuplicates(node)","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 即可","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1f937aeb-8fd6-4fdc-a2fd-cae7fbe76b1e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"public ListNode deleteDuplicates(ListNode head) {\n    if (head == null || head.next == null) {\n        return head;\n    }\n\n    // 如果不重复，则保留头结点\n    if (head.val != head.next.val) {\n        head.next = deleteDuplicates(head.next);\n        return head;\n    }\n\n    // 来到这里就说明重复了，删除与 head 重复的所有节点\n    while (head.next != null && head.val == head.next.val) {\n        head = head.next;\n    }\n\n    return deleteDuplicates(head.next);\n}","collabId":"df4fc777-c0db-4be6-ac56-fa5680bc0151","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"fabca45d-54be-4719-a174-3b3b5c79eef4","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"59b60450-5449-42e7-9f7a-801016e2c3e5"},{"children":[{"text":"参考","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2090ee89-be08-46eb-9438-1dc46910157a","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"删除排序链表中的重复节点 II","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"27606bb3-6a47-4282-a200-04c6ef220bbf","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/remove-duplicates-from-sorted-list-ii/"}],"collabId":"76a48f39-2c35-4e65-b131-16b71b00e80b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"83b549c1-6235-4206-8d38-a32aa2d4d24f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"b1134b1d-7012-47ff-bb0b-4c47735d511b","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"链表"},{"label":"删除排序链表中的重复元素II","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:700","type":"doc","id":700}}],"prevPage":{"title":"反转链表","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:689","type":"doc","id":689}},"nextPage":{"title":"旋转链表","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:706","type":"doc","id":706}},"createTime":1729001277089,"updateTime":1793532544180,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1793532544180}}